| --- | --- |
| Listed rental (3 x $225) | $675.00 |
| Our rental charge (3 x $203, the listed rate less 10%) | $609.00 |
| Booked ahead −5% | −$30.45 |
| Fees (delivery, young driver and the like) and HST | CarmaCars'' own, 100% |
| Kickback receivable (20% of $675) | $135.00 |
| Payable to the partner | $540.00 |

> Good to know: The partner''s monthly statement shows each rental at the listed rate, the kickback and the amount payable; never what the renter paid. A refund lowers the partner''s share in proportion; our discount, lead-time pricing and any discount CarmaCars gives do not. Offers sent and bookings confirmed before the change keep their prices and are paid as before.
